摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Obsidian-compatible long-term memory vault plugin for DeepSeek Harness (DSH): local Markdown storage, sidebar management page, token-budgeted recall, durable journal outbox.","id":"gh:1423816973","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-longterm-memory","slug":"bufan528/dsh-longterm-memory","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","markdown","memory","obsidian"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Obsidian-compatible long-term memory vault plugin for DeepSeek Harness (DSH): local Markdown storage"},{"id":"p1s2","text":", sidebar management page, token-budgeted recall, durable journal outbox."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"DSH Memory Vault · 长期记忆"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"Long-term memory for DeepSeek Harness, stored as a plain Markdown vault you own."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"A first-level sidebar page, four model tools, token-budgeted recall, and a durable\nhistory journal —"},{"id":"p4s2","text":" no database, no telemetry, no cloud. Your memories stay as\nObsidian-compatible .md files on disk."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"= 20\" />"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"Install ·\nDSH Plugin Market ·\ndsh.works ·\nFeatures ·\nConfiguration ·\nData safety ·\nPrivacy ·\nDevelop"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"SH Plugin Market ·\ndsh.works ·\nFeatures ·\nConfiguration ·\nData safety ·\nPrivacy ·\nDevelopment ·\n简体中文"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"> **Project status (2026-10-29).** `dsh-longterm-memory@0.1.8` is published on npm and\n> attached to"},{"id":"p7s2","text":" the\n> latest GitHub Release\n> (with a version-agnostic `dsh-longterm-memory.tgz` asset), and the pl"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"ugin is **listed in\n> two community registries**:\n> the DSH Plugin Market\n> (added 2026-10-19) and t"},{"id":"p7s4","text":"he\n> dsh.works community registry\n> (`dshworks/awesome-dsh-plugins`, **verified**, added 2026-10-19)"},{"id":"p7s5","text":". The in-app\n> **插件市场 / Plugin Market** is the dshmarket\n> plugin and reads that same catalog, so th"},{"id":"p7s6","text":"e plugin is discoverable and one-click\n> installable there as well (no separate submission). Install"},{"id":"p7s7","text":" it from the in-app\n> market, or from npm with `dsh plugin add dsh-longterm-memory@latest`. The desk"},{"id":"p7s8","text":"top-app\n> plugin entry is verified end-to-end in the running desktop app (61/61 real-browser\n> check"},{"id":"p7s9","text":"s over the five pre-existing tabs, real vault, restored afterwards; the 0.1.5 QQ\n> tab was verified "},{"id":"p7s10","text":"separately on an isolated 0.2.1-rc.3 host, see\n> docs/evidence/qq-verification.md). See Install,\n> W"},{"id":"p7s11","text":"hat's new and Project status & limitations."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"### Compatibility caveat"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"The official `@tencent-connect/dsh-qqbot` lists **only DSH `0.1.0-rc.8` and\n`0.2.0-rc.2`** as valida"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"ted; it does **not** validate DSH `0.2.1-rc.3`. The host still\nadmits it because the package has no "},{"id":"p9s3","text":"`engines.dsh` and its `@deepseek-ai/dsh-*` peer\nfloor is evaluated with `includePrerelease: true` — "},{"id":"p9s4","text":"*installable is not validated*.\nThere are open community reports on the 0.2.1 line (issues #60 / #58"},{"id":"p9s5","text":"). See\ndocs/compatibility.md §13."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## Privacy"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"- **No telemetry and no outbound network calls by default.** Host-side acceptance runs\nshowed zero n"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"etwork calls; the only client request targets are the local DSH RPC and,\nwhen the QQ tab is opened, "},{"id":"p11s3","text":"the same-origin read-only `GET /qqbot/im-qqbot/bind` probe\n— both loopback. The 0.1.3 desktop E2E ru"},{"id":"p11s4","text":"n exercised the real page and asserted zero\npage errors / uncaught exceptions; it is not a packet-le"},{"id":"p11s5","text":"vel network audit.\n- **Model use is opt-in**: automatic extraction is rule-based and local; model-as"},{"id":"p11s6","text":"sisted\nextraction (`enableLlmExtraction`) is off and, when enabled, uses the provider you\nconfigured"},{"id":"p11s7","text":" in DSH.\n- **Secrets are refused**: credential-like content (passwords, API keys, tokens,\nprivate ke"},{"id":"p11s8","text":"ys) is blocked before it reaches the vault; sensitive categories require\nexplicit confirmation.\n- **"},{"id":"p11s9","text":"Injection is data, not instructions**: memories are wrapped and labelled as\nuntrusted data for the m"},{"id":"p11s10","text":"odel. See docs/privacy.md."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"## Compatibility"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"| DSH runtime | `>=0.2.1-rc.3 <0.2.2` (`engines.dsh`; `0.2.0-rc.2` is **not** supported) |\n| Verifie"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"d DSH version | `0.2.1-rc.3` — current desktop host; the plugin is loaded and serving RPC on it (see"},{"id":"p13s3","text":" docs/compatibility.md §12) |\n| Node.js | `>=20` |\n| Platform | Windows (primary), Node path rules e"},{"id":"p13s4","text":"lsewhere |\n| npm package | `dsh-longterm-memory` — **0.1.8 published** on npm and GitHub |\n| Downloa"},{"id":"p13s5","text":"ds | Latest GitHub Release — stable alias `dsh-longterm-memory.tgz` (+ `.sha256`), or npm `@latest` "},{"id":"p13s6","text":"(0.1.8) |\n| DSH Plugin Market | **Listed** in awesome-dsh-plugin since 2026-10-19; updates follow th"},{"id":"p13s7","text":"e npm `latest` tag |\n| dshmarket (in-app market) | **Listed** through the same awesome-dsh-plugin ca"},{"id":"p13s8","text":"talog; the live registry checks showed `0.1.4` with 5 screenshots on 2026-10-21 (no separate dshmark"},{"id":"p13s9","text":"et submission) |\n| dsh.works registry | **Listed + verified** in dshworks/awesome-dsh-plugins since "},{"id":"p13s10","text":"2026-10-19; surfaced by the **插件 → DSH 社区** market in the dsh-armory dashboard |"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"The `dsh.compatibility` field is informational; `engines.dsh` is the only decision\nsource. Details a"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"nd evidence: docs/compatibility.md."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"## Project status & limitations"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"- **Preview**: API and storage format may still change; `0.1.0` was the first public\nversion, and `0"},{"id":"p16s2","text":".1.8` is the current release.\n- **npm published**: `dsh-longterm-memory@0.1.8` (2026-10-29); the npm"},{"id":"p16s3","text":" `latest` dist-tag\npoints at it and registry installation is verified. The same build is attached to"},{"id":"p16s4","text":" the\nlatest GitHub Release (`dsh-longterm-memory-0.1.8.tgz` plus the version-agnostic\n`dsh-longterm-"},{"id":"p16s5","text":"memory.tgz` and their `.sha256` files).\n- **Listed in the DSH Plugin Market**: the plugin is in the\n"},{"id":"p16s6","text":"awesome-dsh-plugin\ncatalog (added 2026-10-19). Install it from the in-app **插件市场 / Plugin Market**;\n"},{"id":"p16s7","text":"future releases are picked up automatically from the npm `latest` tag, so no new\nmarketplace submiss"},{"id":"p16s8","text":"ion is needed per version. The China-region catalog mirror may lag\nthe origin by up to about a day.\n"},{"id":"p16s9","text":"- **Available in dshmarket (in-app Plugin Market)**: the\ndshmarket plugin reads the same\nawesome-dsh"},{"id":"p16s10","text":"-plugin catalog live on every open, so this plugin is already reachable in\n**插件市场 / Plugin Market** "},{"id":"p16s11","text":"— no separate dshmarket submission, claim, or association\nstep exists. The live registry on 2026-10-"},{"id":"p16s12","text":"21 showed version `0.1.4` with 5 screenshots;\nupdates follow the npm `latest` tag.\n- **Also listed i"},{"id":"p16s13","text":"n dsh.works**: the entry in\ndshworks/awesome-dsh-plugins is\n`status: verified` with `npm: dsh-longte"},{"id":"p16s14","text":"rm-memory` (added 2026-10-19), so the\n**插件 → DSH 社区** market in the\ndsh-armory dashboard lists and i"},{"id":"p16s15","text":"nstalls it\nwithout any separate dsh-armory submission. Both registries follow the npm `latest`\ntag; "},{"id":"p16s16","text":"dsh-armory revalidates its catalog cache every few minutes (new installs fetch\nfresh).\n- **Desktop v"},{"id":"p16s17","text":"erified**: the full real-browser E2E suite passes against the running\ndesktop app (61/61 checks, the"},{"id":"p16s18","text":" five pre-existing tabs, real vault restored afterwards).\n- **QQ integration (0.1.5)**: the QQ tab, "},{"id":"p16s19","text":"the linkage policy and the diagnostics are\ndocumented in docs/qq-integration.md and were verified on"},{"id":"p16s20","text":" an\nisolated DSH `0.2.1-rc.3` host with a real browser (see\ndocs/evidence/qq-verification.md). They "},{"id":"p16s21","text":"are **not**\npart of the 61-check E2E suite yet. The official QQ plugin is not installed on this\n[该节后"},{"id":"p16s22","text":"**not**\npart of the 61-check E2E suite yet. The official QQ plugin is not installed on this\n[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
